    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71976" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγκος</span></b>  (A), ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>barb</i> of an arrow, in pl.,
				<i>the barbed points,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῦρόν τε καὶ ὄγκους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.151
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				214
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγκοι τοῦ βέλους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Im.</u>
					2.23
				</span></i>
			 : sg., <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				19.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τῆς νεὼς ὄ.</span>”
				<i>brackets,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Moschio
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.208b
			</span></i>.</div>
